[M2] (golly 4.1)
#R B3-jknr4ity5ijk6i8/S23-a4city6c7c
#C fangtian2-immigration-figure-eight.mc.gz
#C GUYTU6J, February 2022
#C
#C Fangtian is a unit cell (or metacell) designed in an isotropic
#C non-totalistic rule named Glimmering Garden by GUYTU6J. It is a
#C more compact equivalent of Adam P. Goucher's p1 megacell, made
#C possible thanks to moderately developed stable signal circuitry
#C and an efficient blinker-pulling device for neighbour calculation.
#C Fangtian-2 is an upgrade to Fangtian, being able to support all
#C 3-state range-1 rules on a square grid with a period of 16777216
#C (2^24) ticks and a unit bounding box of 327680x327680. The primary
#C state appears to be denser than the secondary state at a scale
#C below 2^14:1 inclusive, above which the visual distinction does
#C not exist.
#C 
#C The following pattern is an allied figure eight in a colourised 
#C variant of Life known as Immigration, which was presented on page
#C 31 of Lifeline Volume 3. The two live states follow the classical
#C Game of Life, except that when a cell is born its color will follow
#C the majority of parent cells.
#C
#C A summary for the rule can be found at this wiki page:
#C https://conwaylife.com/wiki/User:GUYTU6J/OCA:Glimmering_Garden
